# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AIsztens — public web SPA configuration.
# This file documents all three environments (local / dev / prod). Copy the
# block you need into the matching per-env file. Real per-env files are
# gitignored and live only on developer machines / the droplet / CI:
#   apps/web/.env.local  → developer machine (local WSL stack, Vite dev proxy)
#   apps/web/.env.dev    → dev droplet build
#   apps/web/.env.prod   → future prod droplet build
#
# Vite loads `.env.<mode>` automatically when you pass `--mode <name>`
# (see `dev:dev`, `build:dev`, `build:prod` scripts in package.json).
# `VITE_*` variables are baked into the JS bundle at build time — there is
# no runtime override.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# local — used by `pnpm --filter @callback/web dev`.
# `/api` is proxied by vite.config.ts to http://localhost:3000, so the
# browser never sees a cross-origin request in dev.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# dev — used by `pnpm --filter @callback/web build:dev` (and by the
# deploy.sh build_spas step that ships the bundle to the dev droplet).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.aisztens.hu/api

# prod — used by `pnpm --filter @callback/web build:prod` when a future
# prod droplet is provisioned. Replace <prod-domain> with the real apex.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.<prod-domain>/api

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build metadata — DO NOT set these by hand.
# They are injected at image build time as Docker build args by
# `.github/workflows/images.yml` (see the `VITE_DEPLOY_DATE` /
# `VITE_COMMIT_HASH` args in `infra/web/Dockerfile`) and rendered in the
# front-page footer by `apps/web/src/components/BuildInfoFooter.tsx`.
# When unset (local `vite` runs) the footer renders the `—` placeholder, so
# leaving them out of the per-env files is expected and correct.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_DEPLOY_DATE=2026-10-12T12:34:56Z   # UTC image build time, ISO 8601
# VITE_COMMIT_HASH=<40-char git sha>      # full commit SHA of the revision
